# Copy to payout-crypto.env (gitignored) and fill in a real value.
# Backs the payout-crypto-creds k8s Secret, consumed by api's
# payout-crypto.util.ts to AES-256-GCM encrypt trainer bank account /
# mobile-money numbers at rest (PayoutAccount, WithdrawalRequest's
# destination* columns).
#
# Deliberately a SEPARATE key from api.env's not-yet-existing
# API_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY equivalent -- a leaked API-token key should not
# also expose trainer bank details (different blast radius/rotation
# lifecycle). Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
payout_account_encryption_key=changeme
